{% comment %}
  Per-order purchase limits: one independent row per product/SKU.

  These limits are separate from customer-order-limit-config.liquid. A product
  may have either limit, both limits, or neither. Changing or removing a row here
  never changes the per-customer allowance or its refresh window.

  Each row takes two values:

    order_limit_handle   EasyStore product handle or SKU. It is matched against
                         both values on cart items, normalized to lowercase.
    order_limit_maximum  units of that SKU allowed in one order/cart. 0 or a
                         missing row leaves the product unlimited per order.

  Example (disabled until a business limit is chosen):

    {% raw %}{% include 'per-order-limit-row', order_limit_handle: 'MTG-HOB-CBB-EN', order_limit_maximum: 2 %}{% endraw %}

  Keep business values here only; customer-wide limits remain in
  customer-order-limit-config.liquid.
{% endcomment %}
